    "body": "I would assume that you'd want to ignore any [[PrivateElements]] slot that's empty.\r\n\r\nSince objects in the spec don't get slots dynamically added, i guess we would indeed need an AO if you wanted 262 to own the logic - but i'm not sure that's ideal given that HTML can add its own slots, as can 402.",
