    "body": "Yeah, that would mean adding `[[PrivateElements]]` to the list of `[[Prototype]]` and `[[Extensible]]` in step 22 quoted in OP. The remaining question is then whether 262 should maintain the logic of that step so that if a new slot is added to basic objects, HTML doesn't need a change there.",
